<title>GREECE: HAMBROS HELLENIC OFFERS NO-LOAD $ FUND AUG 1-31.</title>
<headline>HAMBROS HELLENIC OFFERS NO-LOAD $ FUND AUG 1-31.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambros Hellenic mutual fund management said on Monday its dollar-denominated, fixed income mutual fund will be offered to the investment public during the month of August with no front or back loads.</p>
<p>&quot;Hambros Hellenic offers Greek savers the opportunity to invest in the U.S. currency at fixing rates,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The fund's year-to-date return in drachma terms is 15.76 percent. It is available through General Bank and Hambros Hellenic.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
